# A crashed pass resumes at the head instead of replaying the retained entries
# from its checkpoint, so entries it never applied are lost.
MODULE: QuiescentAtStampedVersionCrashSkipsRetained
TARGET: QuiescentAtStampedVersion
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a crash resumes past the retained entries it had not applied
PERTURBS: Fail

--- FIND
    /\ read' = checkpoint /\ faults' = faults + 1
--- REPLACE
    /\ read' = Len(BL) /\ faults' = faults + 1
--- END
